bio: >-
  Rafid Mostafiz is a PhD student in Computer Science at Iowa State
  University, working under the supervision of Dr. Regis Kopper.
  His research interests include virtual reality, human-computer
  interaction, computer vision, and machine learning. His current
  research focuses on evaluating virtual reality interaction
  technique for distant-object manipulation. He also has research
  experience in deep learning and medical image analysis.

